"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461600/e7bbbf011163d17d987c9de06972a0b415fba212/ss_e7bbbf011163d17d987c9de06972a0b415fba212.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754354956","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1461600/e7bbbf011163d17d987c9de06972a0b415fba212/ss_e7bbbf011163d17d987c9de06972a0b415fba212.600x338.jpg?t=1754354956"}],"short_description":"Project Sparrow is an arena shooter focused on bow and arrow combat, fast-paced movement, and outmanoeuvring your opponent. Fight alongside your teammates in 2v2 and 3v3 or challenge them to a duel. Step into the arena and awaken the archer within.","steam_appid":1461600,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://projectsparrow.dev/faq"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Arabic, Indonesian, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://projectsparrow.dev/"}